{"id":"A2-L001","title":"Past Simple (regular): introduction","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U01","focus":"Past Simple — regular — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Past Simple — regular — introdução","pron":"Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","verbs":["choose"],"pv":["check in"],"expr":["Could you help me?"],"words":["traveler","arrange","come back","riverside","layover","boarding pass","runway","customs","passport control","carry-on","tag","lost luggage","check-in desk","security check","departure lounge","duty-free"],"field":"Viagens","genre":"Anúncio, folheto, aviso","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 1 · Past Simple (regular): introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Past Simple — regular — introdução.","**Verbos:** choose.","**Phrasal verbs:** check in.","**Expressões:** Could you help me?.","**Pronúncia:** Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/.","**10 palavras novas** (viagens).","**Texto do dia:** anúncio, folheto, aviso."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contar o que aconteceu numa viagem usando o Past Simple regular."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["traveler","viajante"],["arrange","organizar"],["come back","voltar"],["riverside","beira do rio"],["layover","layover"],["boarding pass","boarding pass"],["runway","runway"],["customs","customs"],["passport control","passport control"],["carry-on","carry-on"],["tag","tag"],["lost luggage","lost luggage"],["check-in desk","check-in desk"],["security check","security check"],["departure lounge","departure lounge"],["duty-free","duty-free"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A travel flyer","blocks":[{"type":"ad","title":"Remember Your Trip to Lisbon?","lines":["Last June, our guests **visited** the old town, **walked** along the river and **tasted** fresh fish. They **loved** the city and **decided** to return.","Our hotel **offered** free breakfast and **arranged** a tour on the first day. **Could you help me?** said one guest, and the staff **answered** at once.","Book your next trip now!"],"gloss":[["guest","hóspede"],["arrange","organizar"],["tour","passeio guiado"],["return","voltar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The guests visited Lisbon in June.","ans":"T","why":"“Last June…”"},{"q":"The hotel charged for breakfast.","ans":"F","why":"“free breakfast.”"},{"q":"The guests did not like the city.","ans":"F","why":"“loved the city.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“arrange” means…","opts":["organizar","cancelar","pagar"],"ans":0,"why":"arrange = organizar."},{"q":"“tour” means…","opts":["passeio guiado","mapa","ônibus"],"ans":0,"why":"tour."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Past Simple: regular verbs","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Regra","Presente → Passado"],"rows":[["maioria: **+ed**","visit → **visited**, walk → **walked**"],["termina em -e: **+d**","love → **loved**, decide → **decided**"],["consoante + y: **-ied**","study → **studied**, carry → **carried**"],["1 vogal + 1 consoante: dobra","stop → **stopped**, plan → **planned**"]],"cap":"Past Simple: regular verbs"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"O Past Simple é igual para **todos os sujeitos**: *I visited, she visited, they visited*."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não use *did* na afirmativa: *I visited* (não *I did visit*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We ___ the old town. 